#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_currency_revaluation.field_currency_revaluation__reverse
msgid "Reverse Next Period"
msgstr "Revertir el període següent"

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_company__currency_reval_reverse
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_config_settings__currency_reval_reverse
msgid "Reverse the Revaluation"
msgstr "Revertir la reavaluació"

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_currency_revaluation.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Reverse the adjustment at the start of the next period"
msgstr "Revertir l'ajust a l'inici del període següent"

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_company__currency_reval_reverse
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_config_settings__currency_reval_reverse
msgid ""
"Reverse the adjustment entry at the start of the next period: the gains and "
"the losses are only made when the invoices are paid."
msgstr ""
"Revertir l'assentament d'ajust a l'inici del període següent: els guanys i "
"les pèrdues només es realitzen quan es paguen les factures."

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_company__currency_reval_gain_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_config_settings__currency_reval_gain_account_id
msgid ""
"The account credited when the open foreign currency balances are worth more "
"at the closing rate."
msgstr ""
"El compte que s'abona quan els saldos pendents en moneda estrangera valen "
"més al tipus de tancament."

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_company__currency_reval_loss_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_config_settings__currency_reval_loss_account_id
msgid ""
"The account debited when the open foreign currency balances are worth less "
"at the closing rate."
msgstr ""
"El compte que es carrega quan els saldos pendents en moneda estrangera valen"
" menys al tipus de tancament."

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_account_bank_statement_line__currency_reval_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_account_move__currency_reval_date
msgid ""
"The date the open foreign currency balances were revalued at, for the "
"adjustment entries of the currency revaluation."
msgstr ""
"La data en què es van reavaluar els saldos pendents en moneda estrangera, "
"per als assentaments d'ajust de la reavaluació de moneda."

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_company__currency_reval_journal_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_config_settings__currency_reval_journal_id
msgid "The journal of the adjustment entries of the currency revaluations."
msgstr "El diari dels assentaments d'ajust de les reavaluacions de moneda."

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/om_currency_revaluation/wizard/currency_revaluation.py:0
msgid ""
"The open balances are already revalued on %(date)s by the entry %(entry)s. "
"Reverse or delete it before revaluing that date again."
msgstr ""
"Els saldos pendents ja s'han reavaluat el %(date)s per l'assentament "
"%(entry)s. Reverteix-lo o elimina'l abans de tornar a reavaluar aquesta "
"data."

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_currency_revaluation.field_currency_revaluation__date
msgid ""
"The open balances are revalued at the rate of this date, usually the last "
"day of a period."
msgstr ""
"Els saldos pendents es reavaluen al tipus d'aquesta data, generalment "
"l'últim dia d'un període."

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_currency_revaluation.field_currency_revaluation__gain_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_company__currency_reval_gain_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_config_settings__currency_reval_gain_account_id
msgid "Unrealized Gain Account"
msgstr "Compte de guany no realitzat"

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_currency_revaluation.field_currency_revaluation__loss_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_company__currency_reval_loss_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_currency_revaluation.field_res_config_settings__currency_reval_loss_account_id
msgid "Unrealized Loss Account"
msgstr "Compte de pèrdua no realitzada"

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/om_currency_revaluation/wizard/currency_revaluation.py:0
msgid "Unrealized gain"
msgstr "Guany no realitzat"

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/om_currency_revaluation/wizard/currency_revaluation.py:0
msgid "Unrealized loss"
msgstr "Pèrdua no realitzada"

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_currency_revaluation.currency_revaluation_view_form
msgid ""
"What is still open in a foreign currency is restated at the rate of the revaluation date.\n"
"                        The difference is posted as one adjustment entry and reversed at the start of the next\n"
"                        period, since nothing is gained or lost until the invoices are paid."
msgstr ""
"El que encara està pendent en una moneda estrangera es reformula al tipus de la data de reavaluació.\n"
"                        La diferència es publica com un assentament d'ajust i es reverteix a l'inici del següent\n"
"                        període, ja que no es guanya ni es perd res fins que es paguen les factures."

#. module: om_currency_revaluation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_currency_revaluation.currency_revaluation_view_form
msgid "e.g. USD (all the other currencies by default)"
msgstr "per ex. USD (totes les altres monedes per defecte)"
